---
description: Record verification evidence within the accepted task scope
alwaysApply: true
---

Use configured checkpoints/evidence gates before claiming their requirements pass.
Run the appropriate focused checks and retain failures and missing prerequisites.
A mechanical result, author check, combined validation and independent review are
different evidence. Do not claim one from another or invent additional review
cycles. Preserve the accepted action's scope and the configured optional settings.
Keep paired summaries honest and publish successors only through canonical
next-write; no gate hint or HANDOVER fence is an action authority.
